claim.claim-text:
a plurality of tubes (1010), each tube of the plurality of tubes (1010) comprising at least two points provided at a distal end thereof;
a plurality of pins (1040), each pin of the plurality of pins (1040) provided at least partially within a corresponding central lumen of a respective tube of the plurality of tubes (1010);
wherein at least one section of each tube of the plurality of tubes (1010) is structured to be inserted into the biological tissue at a donor site to remove a corresponding portion of the biological tissue therefrom when the at least one section of each tube of the plurality of tubes (1010) is withdrawn from the donor site;
wherein each pin of the plurality of pins (1040) is configured to facilitate a removal of the corresponding portion of the biological tissue from the respective tube of the plurality of tubes (1040); and
wherein the plurality of tubes (1040) includes a first tube and a second tube, the first tube is independently translatable from the second tube.
